OL,3,GNEWSARail users push for full service
OL,4,Ato be restored
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers in Cornwall for whom
OL,7,Fthe railway is a "lifeline" stress
OL,8,Fvital services must be returned to
OL,9,Ftheir regular schedule without delay.
OL,11,FA number of Great Western Railway's
OL,12,F(GWR) new Class 175 trains were
OL,13,Fwithdrawn from the mainline through the
OL,14,Fsouth west in September so they could
OL,15,Fbe repaired.
OL,17,FCommuters said, as well as
OL,18,Finconvenience, fewer services to meet
OL,19,Fdemand had led to carriages being
OL,20,Fovercrowded.
